Rule 2 (input and other tensors must have the same shape when dim is not specified)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= if v_3 = -1 then ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
