Rule 7 (out tensor must have the same shape as input tensor if dim is given)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : tensor, v_4 : int} |= if v_4 ≠ -1 then ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_3) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_3, i)
>>
Rule 8 (input and other tensors must have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0
