Rule 10 (if dim is specified and is a valid dimension, then that dimension must have size 3 for both tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= if v_3 ≥ 0 ∧ v_3 < ndim(v_1) then shape(v_1, v_3) = 3 ∧ shape(v_2, v_3) = 3
